# Flutter architecture

Follow [idea.md](../../idea.md) layout:

- `lib/app/` — `app.dart`, `router.dart`, `theme.dart`
- `lib/core/` — database, utils, shared widgets (no feature UI)
- `lib/features/<feature>/` — `data/`, `domain/`, `presentation/`

Rules:

- State: **Riverpod** (`ProviderScope` at root).
- Navigation: **go_router**; routes in `app/router.dart`.
- Data: **sqflite** behind repository interfaces in `data/`.
- Repositories must not import Flutter widgets or `material.dart`.
- Keep template/`{{var}}` logic in `lib/core/` as pure Dart (see template-engine rule).
